The stage decoration was beautiful and well organized, creating a perfect focal point for the ceremony. The lighting and overall decoration were impressive, giving the entire venue a festive and elegant look. Special thanks to the team for managing the decoration so nicely.

Another highlight was the selfie point and beautifully decorated corners, where guests happily clicked photos and captured wonderful memories throughout the event.

