I recently attended an event at Avantika Marriage Hall, Siswa Bazar, and overall, it was a great experience. The hall is spacious and can comfortably accommodate a good number of guests. The ambience was pleasant, and the decoration was done nicely, making it a great choice for weddings and receptions.

Pros:

✔️ Good Space & Seating Arrangement – Suitable for medium to large gatherings.
✔️ Decent Facilities – Basic amenities like power backup, stage, and clean restrooms were available.
✔️ Convenient Location – Easily accessible from the main area of Siswa Bazar.

Cons:

❌ Catering & Food Quality – The food was decent, but there is scope for improvement.
❌ Management Coordination – Some minor delays in service were observed.

Final Verdict:

A great venue for weddings, receptions, and other functions in Siswa Bazar. With slight improvements in food and service, it can be an even better option! Would recommend it for those looking for a well-managed event space.', 'a year ago', 'GOOGLE_MAPS', '2026-09-22 13:08:06.499749+05:30') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
