One of the main attractions of Vishal Marriage Lawn is its large space, which can accommodate a good number of guests comfortably. The lawn and banquet hall are suitable for big gatherings, and parking space is also available, which is convenient for guests arriving from different locations. The location of the venue is fairly accessible, making it easy to reach for most people.

However, when it comes to services, the experience is not very satisfying. The staff management is one of the biggest drawbacks of this marriage hall. Many staff members do not seem properly trained or well maintained. During events, coordination among staff is often lacking, which creates confusion and delays. Guests sometimes have to wait for basic assistance, and complaints are not handled promptly. For a marriage venue where smooth management is extremely important, this is a major issue.

Food quality is another area where Vishal Marriage Lawn and Banquet Hall needs improvement. While the menu options are decent, the taste and quality of food are inconsistent. Sometimes the food is good, but on other occasions, it feels average or below expectations. In some cases, food is not served hot, and presentation is also quite ordinary. Considering the amount charged per plate, better quality control and hygiene should be maintained.

Decoration is also not up to the mark when compared to the pricing. The decoration provided feels basic and lacks creativity. If you are expecting premium or modern wedding décor, you may feel disappointed. Many families end up arranging external decorators to meet their expectations, which increases the overall budget. For the price charged by the venue, the decoration should be more attractive and well planned.

Cleanliness is another concern. While the hall looks fine at first glance, washrooms and some common areas are not maintained properly during long events. Regular cleaning during functions would greatly improve the guest experience.', '7 months ago', 'GOOGLE_MAPS', '2026-09-22 13:08:21.701909+05:30') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
