The room was clean, spacious, and thoughtfully designed. I really liked the neat layout, fresh linens, and overall cleanliness of the space. The bathroom was well-maintained, with all the essential amenities provided. One thing I truly appreciated was how quiet and peaceful the room felt, making it easy to relax after a long day.

The service at Hotel Blue Stone is definitely one of its strongest points. The staff members were polite, attentive, and always ready to assist with a smile. Whether it was room service or simple queries about the area, they handled everything very professionally.

I also enjoyed the food served at the hotel. The breakfast had a good variety, and each dish tasted fresh and well-prepared. The hotel’s location is another big advantage, with easy access to nearby markets and travel routes.

Overall, Hotel Blue Stone offers a great balance of comfort, cleanliness, and warm hospitality. It’s a place I would happily recommend to anyone looking for a smooth and pleasant stay.

