I had a very disappointing experience with this hotel. The room prices are quite high, but the facilities and services provided do not justify the cost at all.

Whether you book a room for ₹1,000 or ₹3,000, basic drinking water is not provided complimentary in the room. Instead, guests are charged separately for it. Providing basic drinking water should be a standard responsibility of any hotel, especially when guests are already paying a significant amount for accommodation.

The overall service quality is extremely poor, and the facilities do not match the price charged. I feel the hotel is highly overpriced for the kind of service they offer.

I would not recommend this place to others. There is definitely a lot of room for improvement in both customer service and basic guest facilities.
